                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9e977a08-f494-3afe-b530-ea2270887d68",
                        "entry_id": "cf87bb5f-06f1-32f5-97bf-f63380939086",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Hungry and angry, especially when the anger is induced by the hunger."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec553608-514c-4603-a589-ec9c7a997fbd",
                                "sense_id": "9e977a08-f494-3afe-b530-ea2270887d68",
                                "text": "A monster was described as hangry, pronounced by the aythor as [aŋgri]. When asked whether it was angry or hungry, the author replied \"Yes\"."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "58a90c23-2670-482d-abd6-8e8724b70f11",
                                "sense_id": "9e977a08-f494-3afe-b530-ea2270887d68",
                                "text": "I also get really \"hangry\"."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "956b2c0d-f096-43d4-a2c8-1d55bae1d216",
                                "sense_id": "9e977a08-f494-3afe-b530-ea2270887d68",
                                "text": "We're not talking about the fast-food giants or smaller chains, such as Wimpy's, both of which turn up frequently in the stripmalls that dot the Trail. No matter how hungry -- or even hangry -- you and your fellow travellers are, eschew these places."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dbe4eea8-e992-4984-b583-20b9f7ddffa9",
                                "sense_id": "9e977a08-f494-3afe-b530-ea2270887d68",
                                "text": "Seriously, somebody needs to give this toddler a bottle and put him down for a nap. That baby pitches a fit when he gets hangry."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9a8ebaa-d6f7-4f33-9b29-83e13da3354c",
                                "sense_id": "9e977a08-f494-3afe-b530-ea2270887d68",
                                "text": "Mission Control: \"Get them pizza before they get hangry. Hungry and angry!\"\nAstronaut: \"We're hangry! Hungry and angry!\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a2f19a7-4da1-4830-98a8-53fa4a48c92b",
                                "sense_id": "9e977a08-f494-3afe-b530-ea2270887d68",
                                "text": "You know this if you've ever been hangry. You go through your day without stopping to eat, and for a while it doesn't matter. Then your stomach starts sending signals to your brain that it's waiting."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
